#!/bin/sh
set -eu

cat <<'EOF'
Main modifier: Alt

Launchers:
Alt+Shift+Return  terminal
Alt+Shift+m       ncmpcpp
Alt+Shift+h       htop
Alt+Shift+v       nvim
Alt+Shift+t       tmux
Alt+Shift+a       tmux attach
Alt+Shift+f       lf
Alt+Shift+n       nmtui
Alt+Shift+s       area screenshot
Alt+Shift+p       scratchpad
Alt+d             launcher
Alt+Shift+q       session actions

Window/workspace:
Alt+b             toggle Waybar
Alt+j/k           focus next/previous in stack
Alt+o/p           change split direction
Alt+h/l           resize master width
Alt+Return        focus floating/tiled layer
Alt+Tab           previous workspace
Alt+Shift+c       kill window
Alt+t             horizontal split
Alt+Shift+y       floating layout
Alt+y             fullscreen
Alt+u/Shift+u     vertical/horizontal split
Alt+i/Shift+i     tabbed/stacking layout
Alt+Space         toggle split
Alt+Shift+Space   toggle floating
Alt+1..0          workspace on focused output
Alt+Shift+1..0    move window to workspace on focused output
Alt+Comma/Period  focus output
Alt+Shift+Comma/Period move window to output
Alt+-/=           adjust gaps
Alt+Shift+=       reset gaps
Alt+Ctrl+Shift+q  reload Sway
Alt+Ctrl+Shift+x  exit Sway

Wayland-only:
Alt+Arrows        focus spatially
Alt+Shift+Arrows  move window spatially

Input:
Caps Lock is mapped to Escape.
EOF
